# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Aaron Flötotto et al. (2026). Large‐Scale Cooperative Sulfur Vacancy Dynamics in Two‐Dimensional MoS 2 From Machine Learning Interatomic Potentials.
