#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/flototto2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the MACE-MP-0 foundation model, two MACE models
# fine-tuned from it (on 2,000 DFT-labelled snapshots of a foundation-model
# MD run, and on 50,000 AIMD snapshots), and three GAP models trained
# on the fly for sulfur-vacancy structures in 2H-MoS2, with the test RMSEs
# of Table I. NEB barriers, RDFs, MSDs and formation energies are property
# comparisons.

